<title>UK: NordLB adds 500 mln marks to June 2000 Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>NordLB adds 500 mln marks to June 2000 Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by joint lead managers Norddeutsche Landesbank, Bankgesellschaft Berlin, Bayerische Landesbank and Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT  * 500 MLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    15.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  97.965    PAY DATE ** 04.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.225     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES    * FUNGIBLE WITH 1.0 BLN DEM BOND LAUNCHED APRIL 30</p>
<p>	   ** PLUS 79 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    HANN	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.06	SELL CONC  0.165     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
